      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's exactly what i mean. it's so scary because it's not just about what you're doing, it's about what the data says about your brain. if they're already doing this, how would someone even tell? like, if i started noticing my patterns changing or feeling weird, could it be because they're already monitoring me and it's affecting my life? is there any way to actually protect yourself from this kind of covert tracking?",
